X:1
T:Go To Dark Gethsemane
T:GETHSEMANE
C:Music: Richard Redhead, 1853 · Words: James Montgomery, 1820
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Church Hymnal, Revised and Enlarged" (Episcopal), 1896 Ed. Charles Hutchins Hymn 93.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/redhead_no_76): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
